{#
  Table of the vault pages (lazy dialogs): UiKit `table` partial for NowoVaultBundle
  (nowo_ui_kit.theme.bundles.NowoVaultBundle.partials.table, prepended by the bundle; a host value wins).

  It extends the host / kit `table` partial (so an `embed` keeps overriding its blocks) and turns `confirm_shared` on
  unless the caller passes it: row actions with a Confirm (Move to trash, Purge, Revoke access) open ONE shared confirm
  dialog per table, filled from the row toggle when it opens, instead of printing one dialog (title, message, POST
  form + CSRF) per row. Each row keeps its own hidden POST form, target and CSRF token. Pass `confirm_shared: false` to
  get the per-row dialogs back (UiKit 2.67 markup).
#}
{% extends nowo_ui_theme|default(null) ? nowo_ui_theme.partial('table') : '@NowoUiKitBundle/partials/_table.html.twig' %}
{% set confirm_shared = confirm_shared ?? true %}
